{"seq":4,"slug":"workmanager","title":"WorkManager 后台任务管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/architecture-components/workmanager","wordCount":653,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"workmanager-后台任务管理\">WorkManager 后台任务管理</h1><p>WorkManager 是 Android Jetpack 中用于处理可延迟、保证执行的后台任务的推荐方案。即使应用退出或设备重启，WorkManager 也能确保任务最终执行，非常适合日志上传、数据同步、定期清理等场景。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WorkManager 围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>两类任务</strong>：<code>OneTimeWorkRequest</code> 执行一次，<code>PeriodicWorkRequest</code> 周期执行（最小间隔 15 分钟）；用 <code>enqueueUniqueWork</code> / <code>enqueueUniquePeriodicWork</code> 避免重复调度。</li>\n<li><strong>约束条件</strong>：通过 <code>Constraints</code> 声明网络、电量、存储、空闲等前置条件，任务只在满足条件时运行。</li>\n<li><strong>任务链</strong>：<code>beginWith(...).then(...)</code> 串联或并行多个 Worker，前一个任务的输出可作为后一个的输入。</li>\n<li><strong>加急工作与可测试性</strong>：Android 12 起支持 <code>setExpedited</code> 提升优先级（低版本需 <code>getForegroundInfo</code> 提供通知）；测试用 <code>WorkManagerTestInitHelper</code> 与 <code>TestListenableWorkerBuilder</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"onetimework-与-periodicwork\">OneTimeWork 与 PeriodicWork</h2><p>WorkManager 支持两种任务类型：一次性任务和周期性任务。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class SyncWorker(&#10;    context: Context,&#10;    params: WorkerParameters&#10;) : CoroutineWorker(context, params) {&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun doWork(): Result {&#10;        val userId = inputData.getString(&quot;user_id&quot;) ?: return Result.failure()&#10;&#10;        return try {&#10;            val repository = EntryPointAccessors&#10;                .fromApplication&lt;SyncEntryPoint&gt;(applicationContext)&#10;                .syncRepository()&#10;&#10;            repository.syncUserData(userId)&#10;            Result.success(workDataOf(&quot;synced_count&quot; to 42))&#10;        } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;            if (runAttemptCount &lt; 3) Result.retry()&#10;            else Result.failure()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun scheduleSyncWork(context: Context, userId: String) {&#10;    val syncRequest = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&lt;SyncWorker&gt;()&#10;        .setInputData(workDataOf(&quot;user_id&quot; to userId))&#10;        .setBackoffCriteria(&#10;            BackoffPolicy.EXPONENTIAL,&#10;            Duration.ofSeconds(30)&#10;        )&#10;        .addTag(&quot;sync&quot;)&#10;        .build()&#10;&#10;    WorkManager.getInstance(context).enqueueUniqueWork(&#10;        &quot;user_sync_$userId&quot;,&#10;        ExistingWorkPolicy.REPLACE,&#10;        syncRequest&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun schedulePeriodicSync(context: Context) {&#10;    val periodicSync = PeriodicWorkRequestBuilder&lt;SyncWorker&gt;(&#10;        repeatInterval = 6,&#10;        repeatIntervalTimeUnit = TimeUnit.HOURS,&#10;        flexTimeInterval = 30,&#10;        flexTimeIntervalTimeUnit = TimeUnit.MINUTES&#10;    )&#10;        .setInputData(workDataOf(&quot;user_id&quot; to &quot;current&quot;))&#10;        .addTag(&quot;periodic_sync&quot;)&#10;        .build()&#10;&#10;    WorkManager.getInstance(context).enqueueUniquePeriodicWork(&#10;        &quot;periodic_sync&quot;,&#10;        ExistingPeriodicWorkPolicy.KEEP,&#10;        periodicSync&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class SyncWorker(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    context: Context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    params: WorkerParameters</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : CoroutineWorker(context, params) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun doWork(): Result {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val userId = inputData.getString(\"user_id\") ?: return Result.failure()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val repository = EntryPointAccessors</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .fromApplication&#x3C;SyncEntryPoint>(applicationContext)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .syncRepository()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repository.syncUserData(userId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Result.success(workDataOf(\"synced_count\" to 42))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (runAttemptCount &#x3C; 3) Result.retry()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            else Result.failure()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun scheduleSyncWork(context: Context, userId: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val syncRequest = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;SyncWorker>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setInputData(workDataOf(\"user_id\" to userId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setBackoffCriteria(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            BackoffPolicy.EXPONENTIAL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Duration.ofSeconds(30)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .addTag(\"sync\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WorkManager.getInstance(context).enqueueUniqueWork(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"user_sync_$userId\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ExistingWorkPolicy.REPLACE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        syncRequest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun schedulePeriodicSync(context: Context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val periodicSync = PeriodicWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;SyncWorker>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        repeatInterval = 6,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        repeatIntervalTimeUnit = TimeUnit.HOURS,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        flexTimeInterval = 30,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        flexTimeIntervalTimeUnit = TimeUnit.MINUTES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setInputData(workDataOf(\"user_id\" to \"current\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .addTag(\"periodic_sync\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WorkManager.getInstance(context).enqueueUniquePeriodicWork(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"periodic_sync\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ExistingPeriodicWorkPolicy.KEEP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        periodicSync</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务类型</th>\n<th>类</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一次性任务</td>\n<td><code>OneTimeWorkRequest</code></td>\n<td>执行一次</td>\n<td>文件上传、数据迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期性任务</td>\n<td><code>PeriodicWorkRequest</code></td>\n<td>最小间隔 15 分钟</td>\n<td>日志上传、缓存清理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[创建 WorkRequest] --&gt; B{任务类型?}&#10;    B --&gt;|一次性| C[OneTimeWorkRequest]&#10;    B --&gt;|周期性| D[PeriodicWorkRequest]&#10;    C --&gt; E[enqueue / enqueueUniqueWork]&#10;    D --&gt; F[enqueueUniquePeriodicWork]&#10;    E --&gt; G[WorkManager 调度]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[满足约束条件后执行]&#10;&#10;    classDef managerStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class G managerStyle\">graph TD\n    A[创建 WorkRequest] --&gt; B{任务类型?}\n    B --&gt;|一次性| C[OneTimeWorkRequest]\n    B --&gt;|周期性| D[PeriodicWorkRequest]\n    C --&gt; E[enqueue / enqueueUniqueWork]\n    D --&gt; F[enqueueUniquePeriodicWork]\n    E --&gt; G[WorkManager 调度]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[满足约束条件后执行]\n\n    classDef managerStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class G managerStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"约束条件\">约束条件</h2><p>WorkManager 可以设置执行约束，确保任务在合适的条件下运行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val constraints = Constraints.Builder()&#10;    .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.CONNECTED)&#10;    .setRequiresBatteryNotLow(true)&#10;    .setRequiresStorageNotLow(true)&#10;    .setRequiresCharging(false)&#10;    .build()&#10;&#10;val uploadRequest = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&lt;UploadWorker&gt;()&#10;    .setConstraints(constraints)&#10;    .setInitialDelay(5, TimeUnit.MINUTES)&#10;    .build()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val constraints = Constraints.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.CONNECTED)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setRequiresBatteryNotLow(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setRequiresStorageNotLow(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setRequiresCharging(false)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val uploadRequest = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;UploadWorker>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setConstraints(constraints)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setInitialDelay(5, TimeUnit.MINUTES)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .build()</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网络类型</td>\n<td><code>setRequiredNetworkType()</code></td>\n<td>CONNECTED / UNMETERED / NOT_ROAMING</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电量充足</td>\n<td><code>setRequiresBatteryNotLow()</code></td>\n<td>电量不低于临界值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正在充电</td>\n<td><code>setRequiresCharging()</code></td>\n<td>设备正在充电</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储充足</td>\n<td><code>setRequiresStorageNotLow()</code></td>\n<td>存储空间充足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备空闲</td>\n<td><code>setRequiresDeviceIdle()</code></td>\n<td>设备处于空闲状态（API 23+）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"任务链\">任务链</h2><p>WorkManager 支持将多个任务串联或并行执行，形成复杂的工作流。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun scheduleImageProcessingChain(context: Context, imageUris: List&lt;String&gt;) {&#10;    val downloadWork = imageUris.map { uri -&gt;&#10;        OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&lt;DownloadWorker&gt;()&#10;            .setInputData(workDataOf(&quot;image_uri&quot; to uri))&#10;            .addTag(&quot;download&quot;)&#10;            .build()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    val compressWork = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&lt;CompressWorker&gt;()&#10;        .addTag(&quot;compress&quot;)&#10;        .build()&#10;&#10;    val uploadWork = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&lt;UploadWorker&gt;()&#10;        .setConstraints(&#10;            Constraints.Builder()&#10;                .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.UNMETERED)&#10;                .build()&#10;        )&#10;        .addTag(&quot;upload&quot;)&#10;        .build()&#10;&#10;    val cleanupWork = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&lt;CleanupWorker&gt;()&#10;        .addTag(&quot;cleanup&quot;)&#10;        .build()&#10;&#10;    WorkManager.getInstance(context)&#10;        .beginWith(downloadWork)&#10;        .then(compressWork)&#10;        .then(uploadWork)&#10;        .then(cleanupWork)&#10;        .enqueue()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun scheduleImageProcessingChain(context: Context, imageUris: List&#x3C;String>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val downloadWork = imageUris.map { uri -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;DownloadWorker>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .setInputData(workDataOf(\"image_uri\" to uri))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .addTag(\"download\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val compressWork = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;CompressWorker>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .addTag(\"compress\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uploadWork = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;UploadWorker>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setConstraints(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Constraints.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.UNMETERED)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .addTag(\"upload\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val cleanupWork = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;CleanupWorker>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .addTag(\"cleanup\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WorkManager.getInstance(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .beginWith(downloadWork)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .then(compressWork)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .then(uploadWork)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .then(cleanupWork)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .enqueue()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Download 1] --&gt; D[Compress]&#10;    B[Download 2] --&gt; D&#10;    C[Download 3] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[Upload]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Cleanup]&#10;&#10;    classDef parallelStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    classDef seqStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A,B,C parallelStyle&#10;    class D,E,F seqStyle\">graph LR\n    A[Download 1] --&gt; D[Compress]\n    B[Download 2] --&gt; D\n    C[Download 3] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[Upload]\n    E --&gt; F[Cleanup]\n\n    classDef parallelStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef seqStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A,B,C parallelStyle\n    class D,E,F seqStyle</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 链中前一个任务的输出可以作为后一个任务的输入。并行任务的输出会通过 <code>ArrayCreatingInputMerger</code> 或 <code>OverwritingInputMerger</code> 合并。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"加急工作\">加急工作</h2><p>从 Android 12 开始，WorkManager 支持加急工作（Expedited Work），用于需要尽快完成的重要任务。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class CriticalSyncWorker(&#10;    context: Context,&#10;    params: WorkerParameters&#10;) : CoroutineWorker(context, params) {&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun doWork(): Result {&#10;        return try {&#10;            syncCriticalData()&#10;            Result.success()&#10;        } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;            Result.failure()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun getForegroundInfo(): ForegroundInfo {&#10;        val notification = NotificationCompat.Builder(applicationContext, &quot;sync_channel&quot;)&#10;            .setContentTitle(&quot;正在同步数据&quot;)&#10;            .setSmallIcon(R.drawable.ic_sync)&#10;            .setOngoing(true)&#10;            .build()&#10;&#10;        return ForegroundInfo(NOTIFICATION_ID, notification)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    companion object {&#10;        private const val NOTIFICATION_ID = 1001&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun scheduleExpeditedSync(context: Context) {&#10;    val request = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&lt;CriticalSyncWorker&gt;()&#10;        .setExpedited(OutOfQuotaPolicy.RUN_AS_NON_EXPEDITED_WORK_REQUEST)&#10;        .build()&#10;&#10;    WorkManager.getInstance(context).enqueue(request)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class CriticalSyncWorker(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    context: Context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    params: WorkerParameters</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : CoroutineWorker(context, params) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun doWork(): Result {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            syncCriticalData()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Result.success()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Result.failure()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun getForegroundInfo(): ForegroundInfo {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val notification = NotificationCompat.Builder(applicationContext, \"sync_channel\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .setContentTitle(\"正在同步数据\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .setSmallIcon(R.drawable.ic_sync)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .setOngoing(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return ForegroundInfo(NOTIFICATION_ID, notification)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    companion object {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        private const val NOTIFICATION_ID = 1001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun scheduleExpeditedSync(context: Context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val request = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;CriticalSyncWorker>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setExpedited(OutOfQuotaPolicy.RUN_AS_NON_EXPEDITED_WORK_REQUEST)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WorkManager.getInstance(context).enqueue(request)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工作类型</th>\n<th>执行优先级</th>\n<th>前台服务通知</th>\n<th>配额限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通工作</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加急工作</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Android 11 及以下需要</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前台工作</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试\">测试</h2><p>WorkManager 提供了测试工具，支持同步执行和结果验证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@HiltAndroidTest&#10;class SyncWorkerTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val hiltRule = HiltAndroidRule(this)&#10;&#10;    private lateinit var context: Context&#10;&#10;    @Before&#10;    fun setup() {&#10;        context = ApplicationProvider.getApplicationContext()&#10;        val config = Configuration.Builder()&#10;            .setMinimumLoggingLevel(Log.DEBUG)&#10;            .setExecutor(SynchronousExecutor())&#10;            .build()&#10;        WorkManagerTestInitHelper.initializeTestWorkManager(context, config)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun syncWorker_succeeds_withValidInput() {&#10;        val inputData = workDataOf(&quot;user_id&quot; to &quot;test_user&quot;)&#10;        val request = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&lt;SyncWorker&gt;()&#10;            .setInputData(inputData)&#10;            .build()&#10;&#10;        val workManager = WorkManager.getInstance(context)&#10;        workManager.enqueue(request).result.get()&#10;&#10;        val workInfo = workManager.getWorkInfoById(request.id).get()&#10;        assertEquals(WorkInfo.State.SUCCEEDED, workInfo.state)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun syncWorker_retries_onNetworkError() = runTest {&#10;        val worker = TestListenableWorkerBuilder&lt;SyncWorker&gt;(context)&#10;            .setInputData(workDataOf(&quot;user_id&quot; to &quot;invalid&quot;))&#10;            .setRunAttemptCount(0)&#10;            .build()&#10;&#10;        val result = worker.doWork()&#10;        assertEquals(ListenableWorker.Result.retry(), result)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltAndroidTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SyncWorkerTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val hiltRule = HiltAndroidRule(this)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private lateinit var context: Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Before</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        context = ApplicationProvider.getApplicationContext()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val config = Configuration.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .setMinimumLoggingLevel(Log.DEBUG)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .setExecutor(SynchronousExecutor())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WorkManagerTestInitHelper.initializeTestWorkManager(context, config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun syncWorker_succeeds_withValidInput() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val inputData = workDataOf(\"user_id\" to \"test_user\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val request = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;SyncWorker>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .setInputData(inputData)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val workManager = WorkManager.getInstance(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        workManager.enqueue(request).result.get()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val workInfo = workManager.getWorkInfoById(request.id).get()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(WorkInfo.State.SUCCEEDED, workInfo.state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun syncWorker_retries_onNetworkError() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val worker = TestListenableWorkerBuilder&#x3C;SyncWorker>(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .setInputData(workDataOf(\"user_id\" to \"invalid\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .setRunAttemptCount(0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val result = worker.doWork()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(ListenableWorker.Result.retry(), result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>TestListenableWorkerBuilder</code> 可以直接创建 Worker 实例进行单元测试，无需初始化完整的 WorkManager。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>WorkManager 处理可延迟、保证执行的后台任务，支持一次性和周期性任务</li>\n<li>约束条件确保任务在网络、电量、存储等条件满足时执行</li>\n<li>任务链支持串联和并行执行，构建复杂的后台工作流</li>\n<li>加急工作用于高优先级任务，需要实现 <code>getForegroundInfo</code> 提供通知</li>\n<li>使用 <code>WorkManagerTestInitHelper</code> 和 <code>TestListenableWorkerBuilder</code> 进行测试</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WorkManager 后台任务管理","id":"workmanager-后台任务管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"OneTimeWork 与 PeriodicWork","id":"onetimework-与-periodicwork"},{"level":2,"text":"约束条件","id":"约束条件"},{"level":2,"text":"任务链","id":"任务链"},{"level":2,"text":"加急工作","id":"加急工作"},{"level":2,"text":"测试","id":"测试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DataStore 数据存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/architecture-components/datastore"},"next":{"title":"Hilt 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/hilt-fundamentals"}}